===== C-BIOS self-consistency: 30/30 regions byte-identical CF-3300 vs CBIOS2_CUR_MSX1_EU_NOBASIC_DISK =====
ALL IDENTICAL — the disk ROM's BDOS surface is BIOS-independent (C-BIOS matches the stock-validated CF-3300 byte-for-byte).
